{"prefectureId":"09","cities":{"09201":[{"id":"09201:national:9653fa48d55b","cityId":"09201","category":"文化・名所","text":"宇都宮市は2003年（平成15年）にうつのみや百景を選定した。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%AE%87%E9%83%BD%E5%AE%AE%E5%B8%82&oldid=111349359"},{"id":"09201:national:6fafa7f0ef2f","cityId":"09201","category":"産業","text":"宇都宮市は、商・工・農のバランスが高いレベルで取れた、高機能な産業都市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%AE%87%E9%83%BD%E5%AE%AE%E5%B8%82&oldid=111349359"}],"09202":[{"id":"09202:national:70b64babad1a","cityId":"09202","category":"文化・名所","text":"「足利学校跡（聖廟及び附属建物を含む）」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/464"},{"id":"09202:national:358df62fbc49","cityId":"09202","category":"文化・名所","text":"「足利氏宅跡（鑁阿寺）」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/468"},{"id":"09202:national:6bc4df44c8fc","cityId":"09202","category":"地理・自然","text":"市の北部に足尾山地、南部に関東平野が広がり、中央部を渡良瀬川が流れる。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%B6%B3%E5%88%A9%E5%B8%82&oldid=110348570"},{"id":"09202:national:4d0250e27696","cityId":"09202","category":"地域","text":"足利市は、栃木県南西部にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%B6%B3%E5%88%A9%E5%B8%82&oldid=110348570"}],"09203":[{"id":"09203:national:2a03d300a669","cityId":"09203","category":"文化・名所","text":"「吾妻古墳」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/487"},{"id":"09203:national:eb15b0b63028","cityId":"09203","category":"地理・自然","text":"栃木市には太平山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A0%83%E6%9C%A8%E5%B8%82&oldid=111037110"},{"id":"09203:national:c9ec425166d4","cityId":"09203","category":"地理・自然","text":"栃木市には錦着山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A0%83%E6%9C%A8%E5%B8%82&oldid=111037110"},{"id":"09203:national:5cf2351ad9e0","cityId":"09203","category":"歴史","text":"市内各地において大規模な冠水が発生し、避難勧告がなされました。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A0%83%E6%9